---
title: Chicken Fajitas
servings: 4
time: 30 min
tags: chicken, mexican, quick, dinner
cuisine: Mexican
course: main
source: chicken_fajitas.png
---

In a #small bowl{}, whisk together @garlic{1/4%tsp}(minced), @lemon juice{1 1/2%tbsp}, @Worcestershire sauce{3%tbsp}, @black pepper{1/8%tsp}, and @vegetable oil{1%tbsp} to form the marinade.

Toss @boneless skinless chicken breast{1 1/4%lbs}(sliced into long strips) with the marinade. Let rest for ~rest{20%minutes} (or marinate covered in the refrigerator up to all day).

Heat @vegetable oil{1%tbsp} in a #large skillet{} over medium-high heat. Add the chicken strips and cook until white in the center and thoroughly cooked, about ~protein{7%minutes}.

Serve wrapped in warm @flour tortillas{} with crisp @shredded lettuce{}.
